@startuml UC-04-Mencari-Materi
title Sequence Diagram: Mencari Materi

actor "Users (Learner)" as User
participant "Halaman Daftar Materi\ndengan Search Box\n(React)" as UI
participant "GET /api/materi/search" as API
participant "MateriController" as Controller
participant "MateriService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL\n(tabel Materi)" as DB

User -> UI: Berada di halaman daftar materi
activate UI
UI --> User: Menampilkan kolom pencarian
User -> UI: Mengklik kolom pencarian
User -> UI: Mengetikkan kata kunci\n(misal: "database")

opt Real-time search dengan debounce
    UI -> UI: Debounce input\n(delay 500ms)
end

User -> UI: Tekan "Cari" atau Enter

alt Kata kunci >= 3 karakter
    UI -> API: GET /api/materi/search\n?keyword=[keyword]
    activate API
    API -> Controller: searchMateri(keyword)
    activate Controller
    Controller -> Service: searchByKeyword(keyword)
    activate Service
    Service -> Service: Sanitasi keyword\n(prevent SQL injection)
    Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM Materi\nWHERE (judulMateri ILIKE '%keyword%'\nOR kontenMarkdown ILIKE '%keyword%')\nAND status_publik = true\nORDER BY tanggalUnggah DESC
    activate DB
    DB --> Service: Return array hasil pencarian
    deactivate DB
    
    alt Ada hasil ditemukan
        Service -> Service: Highlight kata kunci\ndalam hasil (opsional)
        Service --> Controller: { success: true,\ndata: [...hasil], count: X }
        Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
        API --> UI: Data hasil pencarian
        UI --> User: Menampilkan hasil pencarian\ndengan highlight
        UI --> User: Tampilkan "Ditemukan X materi"
        User -> UI: Memilih materi dari hasil\n(lanjut ke UC-03)
    else Tidak ada hasil
        Service --> Controller: { success: true,\ndata: [], message: "Tidak ada hasil" }
        Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
        API --> UI: Data kosong
        UI --> User: Tampilkan "Tidak ada materi\nyang cocok dengan '[keyword]'"
        UI --> User: Tampilkan saran\n"Coba kata kunci lain"
    end
    
    deactivate Service
    deactivate Controller
    deactivate API
    
else Kata kunci < 3 karakter
    UI --> User: Tampilkan pesan validasi\n"Masukkan minimal 3 karakter"
end

deactivate UI

== Alternate Flow - Menghapus Kata Kunci ==

User -> UI: Menghapus semua teks\ndi kolom pencarian
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/materi\n(request daftar semua materi)
activate API
note right: Kembali ke UC-03\nflow normal
API --> UI: Return semua materi
deactivate API
UI --> User: Tampilkan daftar\nsemua materi
deactivate UI

== Exception: Pencarian Gagal ==

note over DB
  Jika query error:
  - Tampilkan error message
  - Kembalikan ke daftar materi
    sebelum pencarian (cache)
end note

@enduml
